# Summary

The handbook states that vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook[[cite:obs-6043827111fb29ba702ed983486e0194d0c22418 "Vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook."]].

The appendix specifies that bays twelve through thirty are blocked and reserved for supplier vans only, with a midday deadline[[cite:obs-0e2f5ecc258d4b13d58ea42225a559845b6c577b "Bays twelve through thirty: blocked, supplier vans only, midday deadline."]].
